'''Ersi, Mother of Thorns''' is one of the tier 4 [[harvest]] bosses. It is the boss of "Wild" (purple) seeds.

The boss can be found in the [[The Sacred Grove]] at random. The chance can be increased by allocating [[atlas passive skill]] {{psl|Heart of the Grove}} or using a {{il|Harvest Scarab of Cornucopia}}.

Ersi can drop {{il|Wild Crystallised Lifeforce}} and has a chance to drop an exclusive unique item.

==Abilities==
* {{il|Ground Slam}}
* Basic melee attacks
* Charge attack
* Trample
* Creates a vine wall

A minion phase starts at about 60% health and ends after the boss has taken enough damage.

